=== BUG: kind/repo columns show 'unknown'/'-' though real task has kind=task repo=demo-repo ===
Root cause repro: fm_backlog_ledger_resolve_meta() calls bare 'tasks-axi show $id'
without cd'ing into the tasks-axi root or passing --file, unlike fm-captain-hold.sh's
own tasks_axi() wrapper (bin/fm-captain-hold.sh:300-310) which does both.
$ tasks-axi show ledger-demo-1 (run from worktree cwd, no --file -- what resolve_meta does):
error: "Task \"ledger-demo-1\" not found in this backlog"
code: NOT_FOUND
help[1]: Run `tasks-axi list` to see existing tasks

